      "cooked": "<p>Can you translate “Compagnie cedante”?</p>\n<p>Does something simple like this render?</p>\n<p><code>{{ doc.doctype }}</code></p>\n<p>I can confirm the preview does not render the Jinja code, but it works when selecting the letter head in print dialog,</p>\n<p>Here is raw code:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/d/ed3cab53e45de1e734ca6835a34a6b82cc2922d5.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/ed3cab53e45de1e734ca6835a34a6b82cc2922d5\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-11-22 at 8.40.07 AM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/d/ed3cab53e45de1e734ca6835a34a6b82cc2922d5.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-11-22 at 8.40.07 AM\" data-base62-sha1=\"xQH8UCEm1o0jFIBfVQ8r6mfBZbL\" width=\"690\" height=\"428\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F6F6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-11-22 at 8.40.07 AM</span><span class=\"informations\">866×538 7.53 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Here is preview:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/4/b46da1b1c31a288a87cf6007120d6e7814ec26e4.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/b46da1b1c31a288a87cf6007120d6e7814ec26e4\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-11-22 at 8.40.15 AM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/4/b46da1b1c31a288a87cf6007120d6e7814ec26e4.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-11-22 at 8.40.15 AM\" data-base62-sha1=\"pK8PpZ58NTUTPMvNKu4mdru02Wg\" width=\"690\" height=\"390\" data-dominant-color=\"FDFDFD\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use hr