      "id": 487330,
      "username": "Hela_Guesmi",
      "name": "HG",
      "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:26:19.096Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thank you for your response, but the issue is more specific than that.</p>\n<p>The exact same Letter Head works perfectly and renders Jinja variables correctly when printing <strong>regular documents</strong> (like Sales Invoices, custom_doctype, etc.), but fails when printing <strong>reports</strong>.</p>\n<p>To be clear:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Works fine</strong>: Document print formats (Sales Invoice, etc.)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Fails</strong>: All report print outputs ( Database Storage Usage By Tables, etc.)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>“Compagnie cedante” is the name of my custom DocType, but the same issue occurs with standard Frappe reports like “Database Storage Usage By Tables” - the Jinja code appears as plain text in the PDF output.</p>\n<p><strong>The core problem:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Letter Head preview works correctly</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Document printing works correctly</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Report printing doesn’t render Jinja variables</strong> - they appear as literal text</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This affects <strong>all reports across the system</strong> when using the “With Letterhead” option in both PDF and printed outputs.</p>\n<p>this is an example in document printing</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/5/b52d54f116ee8274fa72c39bc8a88397c2d22827.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/b52d54f116ee8274fa72c39bc8a88397c2d22827\" title=\"Capture d’écran du 2025-11-24 11-28-46\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/5/b52d54f116ee8274fa72c39bc8a88397c2d22827_2_690x310.png\" alt=\"Capture d’écran du 2025-11-24 11-28-46\" data-base62-sha1=\"pQLxNkTaAAitz8aaNBogHgWQCQT\" width=\"690\" height=\"310\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/5/b52d54f116ee8274fa72c39bc8a88397c2d22827_2_690x310.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/5/b52d54f116ee8274fa72c39bc8a88397c2d22827_2_1035x465.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/5/b52d54f116ee8274fa72c39bc8a88397c2d22827.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Capture d’écran du 2025-11-24 11-28-46</span><span class=\"informations\">1353×609 32.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>pdf of  document</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/0/60f44b439cdb3e79ebbe8dd3df01d4b26ae45936.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/60f44b439cdb3e79ebbe8dd3df01d4b26ae45936\" title=\"Capture d’écran du 2025-11-24 11-29-51\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/0/60f44b439cdb3e79ebbe8dd3df01d4b26ae45936_2_690x199.png\" alt=\"Capture d’écran du 2025-11-24 11-29-51\" data-base62-sha1=\"dPHexYvNgF14N6OwMkZm13oKcl0\" width=\"690\" height=\"199\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/0/60f44b439cdb3e79ebbe8dd3df01d4b26ae45936_2_690x199.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/0/60f44b439cdb3e79ebbe8dd3df01d4b26ae45936_2_1035x298.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/0/60f44b439cdb3e79ebbe8dd3df01d4b26ae45936_2_1380x398.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Capture d’écran du 2025-11-24 11-29-51</span><span class=\"informations\">1556×451 28.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>but fail in print report:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/c/6cbeb17bb5c37d721b9b0d1ce2483ee88af82352.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/6cbeb17bb5c37d721b9b0d1ce2483ee88af82352\" title=\"Capture d’écran du 2025-11-24 11-32-39\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/c/6cbeb17bb5c37d721b9b0d1ce2483ee88af82352_2_690x138.png\" alt=\"Capture d’écran du 2025-11-24 11-32-39\" data-base62-sha1=\"fw07LG2lcdEbkAYGDD6yTQ5aDD4\" width=\"690\" height=\"138\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/c/6cbeb17bb5c37d721b9b0d1ce2483ee88af82352_2_690x138.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/c/6cbeb17bb5c37d721b9b0d1ce2483ee88af82352_2_1035x207.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/c/6cbeb17bb5c37d721b9b0d1ce2483ee88af82352_2_1380x276.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Capture d’écran du 2025-11-24 11-32-39</span><span class=\"informations\">1411×284 24.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>pdf report:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/b/1b8d868cf4a665ebe3b99d9b904e2bb2449c9390.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/1b8d868cf4a665ebe3b99d9b904e2bb2449c9390\" title=\"Capture d’écran du 2025-11-24 11-35-23\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/b/1b8d868cf4a665ebe3b99d9b904e2bb2449c9390_2_690x235.png\" alt=\"Capture d’écran du 2025-11-24 11-35-23\" data-base62-sha1=\"3VK6Kwm8As9KWTjfHbNl42k2GyY\" width=\"690\" height=\"23